WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:06.900
What have you done, damn you?!

2
00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:20.900
O Great Tensess... May your life shine upon me!

4
00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:30.780
And may the unclean ones be BANISHED!

5
00:00:40.870 --> 00:00:44.370
There's no use of me here, nothing to do.

6
00:00:48.260 --> 00:00:51.760
This is not where I am destined to fall!

7
00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:05.280
STAY WITH NOTHING!
